        <li><strong>Exceeding AOP:</strong> When all slots are filled, gain a second identical AOP (same minimums apply). Transports, Fortifications, and Flyers don't need to be filled to trigger this.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rule-section reveal">
